{"path":"/documentation/intervention/backends/local","section":"documentation","title":"local","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.intervention.backends.local","label":"local","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.intervention.backends.local.LocalSimulationBackend","label":"LocalSimulationBackend","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.local\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">local</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Local-simulation backend: exercise the remote path without a server.</p>\n<p><code>model.trace(..., remote=\"local\")</code> runs the trace here instead of shipping it\nto NDIF. It serializes the trace exactly as <a title=\"            RemoteBackend\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/backends/remote#nnsight.intervention.backends.remote.RemoteBackend\"><code>RemoteBackend</code></a>\nwould, then deserializes it <em>with local (non-installed) modules hidden</em> — mimicking\na server where the user's own source files don't exist — and runs the deserialized\nblock locally against the real model.</p>\n<p>If the block references a local function/class that wasn't shipped by value, the\ndeserialize step raises (<code>ModuleNotFoundError</code>) just as it would on the server,\nso a passing <code>remote=\"local\"</code> run is strong evidence a real remote run will work.\nResults land back in the caller's frame like an ordinary local trace.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.local.LocalSimulationBackend\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">LocalSimulationBackend</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"LocalSimulationBackend(model: Any, verbose: bool = False)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><a title=\"            Backend (nnsight.tracing.backend.Backend)\" href=\"/documentation/tracing/backend#nnsight.tracing.backend.Backend\">Backend</a></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>Serialize/deserialize a trace locally (user modules hidden), then run it.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.local.LocalSimulationBackend.model\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">model</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"model = model"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.local.LocalSimulationBackend.verbose\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">verbose</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"verbose = verbose"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.backends.local.LocalSimulationBackend.__call__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__call__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__call__(tracer: Any) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"}]}